ther you’re protecting manufacturing lines, energy operations, or AI data centers, Cyolo helps your teams and partners connect quickly, safely, and securely. Cyolo removes the access barriers that slow industrial enterprises down. Organizations across industries rely on Cyolo to keep critical work resources connected and secure. Below is a look at how we support the unique operational needs of various sectors with clarity, control, and no unnecessary complexity. Have a question about your industry? Get in touch with us today. Manufacturing Connected production lines and smart-factory systems create new pathways for cyberattacks that can disrupt operations and impact worker safety. Cyolo helps manufacturers boost security and maximize uptime by securing all connections to critical OT environments with identity-based, least-privilege controls. Learn more Data Centers The data centers that power the modern digital economy are under constant threat. Any small service interuption could lead to site-wide downtime and cause serious economic harm. Cyolo gives data center teams precise, identity-based control over every connection, helping to maximize uptime and prevent disruption. Learn more Energy & Utilities Cyberattacks on energy or utilities infrastructure can be disastrous, leading to prolonged outages, disruption of essential services, and serious environmental harm. Rising connectivity and reliance on legacy systems only increase this vital sector's vulnerability. Cyolo allows E&U organizations to secure and control user access to critical OT/ICS systems, minimizing the risk of a catastrophic incident. Learn more Oil & Gas The oil and gas (O&G) sector faces escalating attacks by threat actors who recognize its enormous value. At the same time, advancements in automation, growing connectivity, and the spread of remote work have created new opportunities but also new vulnerabilities for the industry. Cyolo enables badged employees and third-party vendors to connect securely to even the most sensitive systems. Learn more Life Sciences & Pharma Threats to operations, intellectual property, and safety make securing life sciences & pharma infrastructure from cyberattacks a vital priority. The Cyolo PRO secure remote access solution helps you keep sensitive data safe, from research to production. Learn more",
